  "question": {
    "text": "Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#946;</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>&#947;</mi></math>&nbsp;be the three&nbsp; roots of the equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;if&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#946;</mi><mi>&#947;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#945;</mi></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>b</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>c</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>&#945;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi>&#946;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn><msup><mi>&#947;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;is equal to&nbsp;",
    "image": null
  },
